<ReportLayout title="About" description="The research and engineering intent behind Open Smart Desk."><section class="report-container py-16 md:py-24"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-text">About the project</p><h1 class="text-4xl text-ink sm:text-5xl">The desk is the input. The habit is the problem.</h1><div class="prose prose-site mt-10 max-w-[75ch] prose-headings:font-display prose-p:leading-8"><p>Open Smart Desk is an open research and engineering project for people who want to alternate between sitting and standing. The desk raises manually. The system measures its height and uses a desktop application to help the person notice and change position.</p><p>The project is intentionally evidence-led. A prototype that works electrically is not the same as a product that works for a person, so current pages distinguish in-use, in-review and planned work.</p></div></section></ReportLayout>
